			"content": {
				"id": "OPENSSH-2015-08-11-1",
				"title": "Weak TTY device permissions; MaxAuthTries circumvention in keyboard-interactive authentication.",
				"description": "OpenSSH 6.7 through 6.9 assign weak permissions to TTY devices.\n\nKeyboard-interactive authentication in OpenSSH prior to 7.0 may allow circumvention of MaxAuthTries.\n\nThese bugs are corrected in OpenSSH 7.0. For more information, please refer to the release notes",
